      "message": "Hi gkolodziejczyk@, seems I missed some context for b/329172203, I wanna double confirm that the final behavior would be:\n\n1. If app attempt to set classic device to active during broadcast, stack will stop broadcast and handover to unicast, audio will be routed to LEA device.\n2. If app stop the broadcast and then set classic device to active, stack will block the handover and audio will be routed to classic device.\n\nIs that correct?",
